Z||000000||LPR||04-30-2001||09:07 PM||||Sorry Fieroparts.com I just re-read your post and realized that Old Orchard beach is in Maine, duh, at the computer too long. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"><P>I want to know more about it, is it on Fiero drive, if not were is it?  Is it a big event? I can't wait to go!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I've been jealous of all the Fiero meetings and shows that were just tooo far away! Thanks for the info! Luc<P>------------------<BR>1984 SE 89K<BR>"Your only as smart as your weakest think."||||reg||6
Z||000001||Old Lar||04-30-2001||10:34 PM||||On the map, it looks like the show is on Route 9 (East Grand Ave) in Old Orchard Beach.  Just a hop, skip and jump from the rt 195 exit from the turnpike.  It is just down the road from the Cross Winds Cotteges and motel.<P>1 Fiero Drive is where Tim's estate is located.||||reg||4
